tholics and the Protestants finally escalates, as the king declares war — forcing the now four musketeers into battle. But as the war goes on, they are tested physically, mentally and emotionally.","tagline":"The epic adventure continues..."},{"language":"fr-FR","overview":"Constance Bonacieux est enlevée sous les yeux de D'Artagnan. Dans une quête effrénée pour la sauver, le jeune mousquetaire est contraint de s'allier à la mystérieuse Milady de Winter. Alors que la guerre est déclarée, Athos, Porthos et Aramis ont déjà rejoint le front. Par ailleurs, un terrible secret du passé va briser toutes les anciennes alliances.","tagline":"L'aventure épique continue..."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wRMWyrlmWE8B7eN42s1LoJ8PfHx.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tWVXGyDNQM7zRKp162PSdBSgCzb.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":845111,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"fr-FR","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wRMWyrlmWE8B7eN42s1LoJ8PfHx.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wRMWyrlmWE8B7eN42s1LoJ8PfHx.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wRMWyrlmWE8B7eN42s1LoJ8PfHx.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wRMWyrlmWE8B7eN42s1LoJ8PfHx.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oZWCrjbrqGpGzusacdRyOVLZC9i.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/oZWCrjbrqGpGzusacdRyOVLZC9i.jpg","language":"it","width":1333,"height":2000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/r4chVyS0h6YH4y7etFLn6hJlYDK.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/r4chVyS0h6YH4y7etFLn6hJlYDK.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image